NOTE: The HTML template uses [(ngModel)]="promptValue" as a concise template example.
Add this property to the component if using that exact binding:

promptValue = this.prompt();

Alternatively replace the textarea with:
<textarea [ngModel]="prompt()" (ngModelChange)="prompt.set($event)" rows="3"></textarea>

For a production adapter, replace the minimal fetch/SSE parser with the official AG-UI TypeScript client and implement full state-delta handling.
